From: Noam Camus <ncamus@gaudilabs.com>
Date: Sat, 06 Jan 2018 10:17:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add uboot-test-hooks support

It will serve for testing U-Boot
---

diff --git a/Config.in b/Config.in
index e51bc76..f9e9de2 100644
--- a/Config.in
+++ b/Config.in
@@ -2,5 +2,6 @@
